cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or write about RangerTrak, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RangerTrak"
abstract: >-
  Offline-first PWA that maps who is where, when, and in what condition, for
  CERT, ACS/ARES, SAR and wildland-fire teams reachable only by voice radio.
  No server, no account, no Internet once loaded. Prints ICS-309 and ICS-213.
authors:
